---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Visual System Setup — Nrvana Studio">
  <section class="section pt-24 pb-12">
    <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: var(--color-accent-alt);">For your team</div>
    <h1 class="mt-4 font-display text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-[0.95] max-w-4xl">
      Your brand exists. <em>The operational layer doesn't.</em>
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg" style="color: var(--color-ink-soft);">
      For teams that already have a brand but need the working layer: a machine-readable kernel, a tuned prompt library, and the templates everyone actually uses.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="section py-8">
    <div class="grid gap-4 rounded-2xl border p-8 sm:grid-cols-3"
         style="border-color: var(--color-line); background-color: var(--color-canvas-soft);">
      <div><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: var(--color-ink-mute);">Length</div><div class="mt-1 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">1–2 weeks</div></div>
      <div><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: var(--color-ink-mute);">Outcome</div><div class="mt-1 font-display text-2xl font-semibold">Operational layer</div></div>
      <div><div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: var(--color-ink-mute);">Fee</div><div class="mt-1 font-display text-2xl font-semibold" style="color: var(--color-accent-deep);">$4k–$8k</div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section py-12">
    <ul class="space-y-3" style="color: var(--color-ink-soft);">
      <li>· Brand Kernel (machine-readable version of what's in the PDF).</li>
      <li>· Prompt Library tuned to the existing brand.</li>
      <li>· 3–5 templates installed (deck, social, headers).</li>
      <li>· Team training on the toolkit.</li>
      <li>· Internal runbook so non-designers self-serve without breaking the brand.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="section py-20">
    <div class="rounded-2xl p-10 text-center" style="background-color: var(--color-ink); color: var(--color-canvas);">
      <h2 class="font-display text-4xl font-semibold">Set up the working layer.</h2>
      <div class="mt-8">
        <a href="/contact?ref=visual-system" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md px-6 py-3 font-medium"
           style="background-color: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-canvas);">Talk through it →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
